{"parse": {"title": "TMW-08", "pageid": 119353, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-07\" title=\"TMW-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TMW-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/TMW-09\" title=\"TMW-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TMW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.93.81.E9.81.93.E7.8C.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铁道猫\">铁道猫</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 铁道猫</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Railway Cat</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>血<span class=\"color-value\"></span>食<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>哪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>风<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>迷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>须<span class=\"color-value\"></span>找<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>否<span class=\"color-value\"></span>则<span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>车<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>法<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>​<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3110108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chexiangyewa\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chexiangyewa\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>时间已来到深夜。<br />完成登记的乘客陆续回到各自的车厢，在香软的卧铺中进入沉沉梦乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧嚣散尽，车厢内只剩两名乘客面对面坐着，彼此沉默不语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这位女士，你可以先放下笔。现在是我在做信息登记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>空心木，英国人，神秘学家。喜欢咖啡、银鳕鱼还有起风的夜晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>讨厌截稿日和下雨天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>好了，以上就是我能给到你的全部信息。接下来轮到我了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>撰稿人放下笔，忽然凑了上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>找到了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我不太明白您的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>哦，看样子是没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她兴致缺缺地朝调查员摆了摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>在你这样一本正经的家伙身上，再有趣的素材恐怕都会变成乏味的档案记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>再见，祝你工作顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员干脆地收起笔和文件，然而撰稿人像是忽然想到了什么，再度开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>不过……看你这么辛苦地忙前忙后，我就投喂你一点儿“小甜点”吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>撰稿人凑近身子，诡魅地朝调查员眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>听说……之前的乘客总能在夜晚听到哭声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>哭声？什么样的哭声？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>一开始很轻，后来嘶嘶地、很长很长，像一条线……然后又突然卡住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她慢慢掐住自己的脖子，朝调查员露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>……就像小猫被掐住一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>怎么样，喜欢我讲的鬼故事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>哦，还不错。你后面有东西，就悬在半空中……看上去很像那只被掐住的小猫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她面无表情地回击了一个拙劣的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>不，你什么都没看到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>撰稿人挺直背脊，面带自信的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空心木：</div><div>回去忙你的工作吧，“一无所知”小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>登记工作总算告一段落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员略感到疲惫。她踱回自己的座位，翻开来时携带的文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>穿越半岛为数不多的列车之一……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>来历不明的乘务组成员和闹鬼车厢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>至于乘客……刚才已经登记了一遍，身份都能对上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员收起文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都无可挑剔地顺理成章，仿佛所有的荒谬都有其存在的理由，但却又隐隐地透露出不对劲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>重塑之手还是没能浮出水面。看来关键还是在于那位列车长……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>她到底在隐瞒什么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chexiangyewa\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chexiangyewa\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-638112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-638112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-638112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……停车了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乘客Ⅱ：</div><div>你好，先生……列车怎么忽然停靠了？才刚睡下没多久呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员匆忙穿梭在走廊里，轻言安抚被惊醒的乘客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乘务员：</div><div>各位，很抱歉……列车现在是临时停车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乘务员：</div><div>由于大雪天气的缘故，铁路暂时无法通行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乘务员：</div><div>我们正在加紧处理，请各位乘客不要惊慌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-639320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乘务员：</div><div>现在为诸位提供夜间点心，我们备有莱比锡的云雀蛋糕和东方风情的土耳其软糖，如果您还有其他需要，请随时招手示意我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>大雪？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_waijing\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_waijing\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"125\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_waijing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"854\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员悄悄挑开窗帘一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗外雪花不时飘飞，吹落在沉默的群山之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不错的借口，但这可不足以成为停车的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远在列车的另一侧，这场小小的风波并未影响到女孩的好睡眠。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-312520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-312520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-312520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>野树莓四仰八叉地躺在沙发上，呼吸分外均匀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她这一天经历了太多起伏，新朋友的倾听与安慰无疑成了她最好的助眠药剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>真奇怪，我还是第一次见到会在夜里睡觉的血食怪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出手，一点点靠近女孩的睡颜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>呀！时间到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员摇摇头，整理了一下女孩颊边的碎发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>笑得这么开心，一定是在做什么美梦吧。不过……我得暂时离开一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身，悄悄带上门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>室外流入的光线被阴影慢慢侵蚀，直至门完全合上，房间陷入一片黑暗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-637301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>晚安，小树莓。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_tingkaodian\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_tingkaodian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_tingkaodian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空气里弥漫着湿木、腐叶、雪和阴谋的气息。女孩在昏暗的树影中穿梭，时隐时现，幽灵般游走于林木之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>早早下车的列车长等候在雪地里，捻碎了一片片落在她手心的雪花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>你来迟了。遇到意外了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>抱歉……我刚把那个血食怪女孩儿哄睡着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>有人知道你下车了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>静悄悄的森林里，列车无声无息地停靠在铁轨上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪仍慢慢地下着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我走得很小心，没人会发现我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>很好，那走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>别让他们久等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人一前一后，朝着列车末尾走去，迅速消失在漆黑的雪夜之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪地上，另一人的脚印远远地跟在后边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-638113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>果然……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TMW-08"}}